<h1>
	Univention Microsoft 365 Connector v5.1
	<br>
</h1>
<ul style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;">
	<li>
		The Microsoft 365 Connector has been completely migrated to use the Microsoft Graph API. The previously used API will be deprecated at the end of 2022, the connector App has to be updated to version 5.1 before that.
	</li>
	<li>
		If the setup of the Microsoft 365 Connector has been done in version 4.0 or lower, the connections may not have the necessary permissions yet.
		<br>
	</li>
	<li>
		<b>Please check if each of your applications has the appropriate permissions for the Graph API as described in https://help.univention.com/t/18453 before upgrading</b>
	</li>
</ul>